<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In Evaluating Behavioral Alignment in Conflict Dialogue:A Multi-Dimensional Comparison of LLM Agents and Humans" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>LLM Simulation</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
