<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS2" title="In Appendix B LLM Simulation ‣ Evaluating Behavioral Alignment in Conflict Dialogue:A Multi-Dimensional Comparison of LLM Agents and Humans" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.2 </span>Model Hyper-parameters</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
