<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Evaluating Behavioral Alignment in Conflict Dialogue:
<br class="ltx_break">A Multi-Dimensional Comparison of LLM Agents and Humans</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Deuksin Kwon
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>University of Southern California
</span>
