<tr id="A3.T3.2.1.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.2.1.5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Expressing positive outlook by recognizing common goals or similarities.</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.2.1.5.3.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.2.1.5.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">E.g.: ’You and I both want to conclude this conversation well.’</td></tr>
</table></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.2.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
