<tr id="A3.T3.2.1.7.3.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.2.1.7.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Statements about procedures or rules, or introductory remarks.</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.2.1.7.3.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.2.1.7.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">E.g.: ’Hello, can we please talk about this issue?’</td></tr>
</table></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.2.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
